# Phishing Email Detection Model

A machine learning project built using Python and Scikit-learn to classify emails as Phishing or Safe.

## Features
- Email text preprocessing
- TF-IDF feature extraction
- Naive Bayes classification
- Accuracy evaluation
- Confusion matrix visualization

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn

## Results
The model predicts whether an email is phishing or legitimate based on textual content.
